    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Two college students walk in circles, taking heavy steps. One has a blanket on his shoulder. Both wear "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "willow branches",
            "zh": "柳枝"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on their heads. Suddenly, they start dancing wildly. It looks like they’re seeing a camera for the first time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Meng Yan and his friend Meng Jiawei are two students from Hebei. They were applying for a summer job as “caveman” performers at the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "East Taihang Scenic Area",
            "zh": "东太行景区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Last summer, several scenic spots across China used caveman performances to attract more visitors. The East Taihang Scenic Area’s job posting was simple: “Earn 200 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a day. No talking. Only oh-ho’s. Forget human speech and go wild!” The next day, hundreds of applications flooded in. People "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "from all walks of life"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " expressed their interest in the job. There were college students, teachers, and even programmers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the end, only twenty applicants received job offers, including Meng Yan and his friend. Without any training, they put on their caveman "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "costumes",
            "ref": "v-costume"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and went to a “performance zone” on the mountain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Once he started, Meng went all out. He walked on all fours, climbed trees to do pull-ups, and even "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mimicked",
            "ref": "v-mimic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tourists while "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "roaring",
            "ref": "v-roar"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like a wild animal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“Those days were enjoyable because I could escape real life for a while,” he said. “It’s usually hard to reach a state of mind where I don’t have to think about anything.” His friend Jiawei felt the same way. “Those days truly allowed me to release all the stress from my real life,” he said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The caveman performances didn’t attract many new visitors. But they drew a lot of attention to East Taihang. Some caveman videos were viewed nearly 120 million times on social media."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Meng made 1,400 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from his summer job. But what he "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "treasures",
            "ref": "v-treasure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " most are the memories. He still misses the freedom he found in the mountains."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
